codex
I can apply the urgency change with two added ReLU layers. The existing weights will stay unchanged.

An exact switch at confidence 0.4 is impossible for a continuous ReLU network over all real inputs. I will use a transition narrower than the spacing between adjacent float64 values at 0.4. This gives the requested switch for the supplied Python evaluator.
